OL,3,GNEWSAFour to face trial accused of
OL,4,Amurdering baby
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour people accused of murdering a
OL,7,Fnewborn baby found dead at a house in
OL,8,FSheffield are to stand trial next year.
OL,10,FThe baby girl, who suffered 33 wounds
OL,11,Fin 15 separate stabbings, was found at
OL,12,Fa house in Holywell Heights, in the
OL,13,FWincobank area of the city, on Sunday.
OL,15,FAndrea Skopova, 20, Peter Horvath, 19,
OL,16,FPeter Horvath, 38, and Nina Horvathova,
OL,17,F37, appeared at Sheffield Crown Court
OL,18,Fcharged with murdering the child, named
OL,19,Fonly as Baby S. A 15-year-old girl also
OL,20,Fappeared in court charged with
OL,21,Fperverting the course of justice.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
